{"sha": "ca0b5a2f7003bfb2201180349fe7b619aa114cc30385f7e790f92efa64b169f9", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b1:series} 章 --- 数值级数}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:series:1}", "$\\dfrac{1}{n(n+1)} = \\dfrac1n - \\dfrac{1}{n+1}$：裂项相消，$S_N =", "1 - \\frac{1}{N+1} \\to 1$。收敛，和为 $1$。", "", "$\\ln\\bigl(1 - \\frac{1}{n^2}\\bigr) = \\ln\\frac{(n-1)(n+1)}{n^2} =", "\\ln\\frac{n-1}{n} - \\ln\\frac{n}{n+1}$：仍是裂项相消，$S_N =", "\\ln\\frac12 - \\ln\\frac{N}{N+1} \\to -\\ln 2$。收敛，和为 $-\\ln 2$。", "", "$\\dfrac{3^n + 4^n}{5^n} = \\bigl(\\frac35\\bigr)^n +", "\\bigl(\\frac45\\bigr)^n$：两个收敛的等比级数，和为", "$\\frac{1}{1 - 3/5} + \\frac{1}{1 - 4/5} = \\frac52 + 5 = \\frac{15}{2}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:series:2}", "全部使用比值判别法。", "", "$\\frac{u_{n+1}}{u_n} = \\frac{(n+1)^2}{2n^2} \\to \\frac12 < 1$：", "收敛。", "", "$\\frac{u_{n+1}}{u_n} = \\frac{(n+1)!\\,n^n}{n!\\,(n+1)^{n+1}} =", "\\bigl(\\frac{n}{n+1}\\bigr)^n = \\bigl(1 + \\frac1n\\bigr)^{-n} \\to", "\\frac1\\eu < 1$：收敛。", "", "乘上因子 $2^n$ 后，比值 $\\to \\frac2\\eu < 1$：收敛。", "", "取 $3^n$ 时，比值 $\\to \\frac3\\eu > 1$：发散（项趋于", "$+\\infty$）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:series:3}", "各项均非负，利用等价关系", "（见\\cref{thm:b1:series:positive}）。", "", "$\\sin\\frac{1}{n^2} \\sim \\frac{1}{n^2}$：收敛（黎曼 $\\alpha", "= 2$）。", "", "$1 - \\cos\\frac1n \\sim \\frac{1}{2n^2}$：收敛。", "", "$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{n(n+1)}} \\sim \\frac1n$：发散。", "", "$\\frac{\\ln n}{n^2} = \\frac{1}{n^{3/2}}\\cdot\\frac{\\ln n}{n^{1/2}}$", "而 $\\frac{\\ln n}{\\sqrt n} \\to 0$", "（见\\cref{prop:b1:functions:powerrules}），于是 $\\frac{\\ln n}{n^2} \\leq", "\\frac{1}{n^{3/2}}$（$n$ 充分大时）：收敛。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:series:4}", "当 $n \\geq 2$ 时，$\\frac{1}{n^2} \\leq \\frac{1}{n(n-1)} =", "\\frac{1}{n-1} - \\frac1n$。因此", "\\[", "\\sum_{n=1}^{N} \\frac{1}{n^2} \\leq 1 + \\sum_{n=2}^{N}", "\\Bigl(\\frac{1}{n-1} - \\frac1n\\Bigr) = 1 + 1 - \\frac1N < 2 :", "\\]", "部分和单调递增且以 $2$ 为上界，由", "\\cref{thm:b1:series:positive}可知级数收敛，和 $\\leq 2$。（精确值", "$\\frac{\\pi^2}{6}$ 留待本科二年级再来欣赏。）", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:series:5}", "$\\sum \\frac{(-1)^n}{\\sqrt n}$：交错级数，且 $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt n}", "\\downarrow 0$，故收敛（见\\cref{thm:b1:series:alternating}）；不", "绝对收敛（$\\alpha = \\frac12 \\leq 1$）。", "", "$\\sum \\frac{(-1)^n}{n + (-1)^n}$：数列 $\\frac{1}{n +", "(-1)^n}$ \\emph{不是}递减的（$\\frac{1}{n+1}$ 与", "$\\frac{1}{n}$ 交替出现），因此不能直接使用判别法。", "展开：", "\\[", "\\frac{(-1)^n}{n + (-1)^n}", "= \\frac{(-1)^n}{n}\\cdot\\frac{1}{1 + \\frac{(-1)^n}{n}}", "= \\frac{(-1)^n}{n} - \\frac{1}{n^2} +", "O\\Bigl(\\frac{1}{n^3}\\Bigr):", "\\]", "第一个级数收敛（交错级数），$\\sum \\frac{1}{n^2}$", "收敛，$O(n^{-3})$ 所对应的级数绝对收敛：三个收敛级数之和", "仍收敛。", "", "$\\sin\\bigl(\\pi\\sqrt{n^2+1}\\bigr)$：记 $\\sqrt{n^2 + 1} = n +", "\\frac{1}{2n} + \\varepsilon_n$，其中 $\\varepsilon_n = O(n^{-3})$；", "于是由 $\\pi$ 周期性（对 $\\sin$ 而言至多相差符号），", "\\[", "\\sin\\bigl(\\pi\\sqrt{n^2+1}\\bigr)", "= (-1)^n \\sin\\Bigl(\\frac{\\pi}{2n} + \\pi\\varepsilon_n\\Bigr) .", "\\]", "记 $\\theta_n = \\frac{\\pi}{2n} + \\pi\\varepsilon_n$，$a_n =", "\\sin\\theta_n$。当 $n$ 充分大时，$\\theta_n \\in \\intoo{0}{\\frac\\pi2}$", "且", "\\[", "\\theta_n - \\theta_{n+1} = \\frac{\\pi}{2n(n+1)} +", "\\pi(\\varepsilon_n - \\varepsilon_{n+1})", "= \\frac{\\pi}{2n^2} + O\\Bigl(\\frac{1}{n^3}\\Bigr) > 0", "\\]", "从某项起 $(\\theta_n)$ 递减并趋于 $0$；由于 $\\sin$ 在", "$\\intcc{0}{\\frac\\pi2}$ 上递增，故 $(a_n)$ 也递减趋于", "$0$。由交错级数判别法可知级数收敛 --- 但非绝对收敛，", "因为 $a_n \\sim \\frac{\\pi}{2n}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:series:6}", "$f(t) = \\frac{1}{t(\\ln t)^\\alpha}$ 为正、连续、", "在 $\\intco{2}{+\\infty}$ 上递减。作代换 $u = \\ln t$：", "\\[", "\\int_2^x \\frac{\\dd t}{t(\\ln t)^\\alpha}", "= \\int_{\\ln 2}^{\\ln x} \\frac{\\dd u}{u^\\alpha},", "\\]", "当 $x \\to \\infty$ 时有界，当且仅当 $\\alpha > 1$", "（同\\cref{thm:b1:series:riemann}中的计算）。由积分判别法", "比较可得：级数收敛当且仅当 $\\alpha > 1$。（这类\\emph{贝特朗型}", "级数显示了收敛边界的精细程度：$n\\ln n$", "发散，$n(\\ln n)^{1.01}$ 收敛。）", "\\end{solution}", ""]}